#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti records this outcome before verifying account enabled, realm authorization, or 2FA completion; a session may not have been established."
msgstr "Mirakitra ity vokatra ity i Cacti alohan'ny hanamarinana raha mavitrika ny kaonty, ny fanomezan-dalana realm, na ny fahavitan'ny 2FA; mety tsy mbola nisy fivoriana natsangana."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "No current Cacti path writes this signature; recorded defensively as a possible password change with an unconfirmed outcome."
msgstr "Tsy misy lalan'ny Cacti ankehitriny manoratra ity sonia ity; voarakitra ho fiarovana toy ny mety ho fanovana tenimiafina tsy voamarina ny vokany."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti user_log result=3 with user_id=0 may be a password change or a failed 2FA challenge; the table cannot disambiguate."
msgstr "Ny user_log Cacti misy result=3 sy user_id=0 dia mety ho fanovana tenimiafina na tsy fahombiazana tamin'ny fanamarinana 2FA; tsy afaka manavaka izany ny tabilao."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Audit administration permission is required to save these settings."
msgstr "Ilaina ny alalana hitantana ny fanaraha-maso mba hitahirizana ireo fandrindrana ireo."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Authentication auditing was not enabled. Run the audit_auth_indexes.php CLI maintenance command first."
msgstr "Tsy navitrika ny fanaraha-maso ny fanamarinana. Alefaso aloha ny baiko fikojakojana CLI audit_auth_indexes.php."

